Package: UTRunway
Type: Package
Title: Profile and Rank Candidate mRNA Construct Designs
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Melody", family = "Mo",
           email = "melody.mo@mail.utoronto.ca",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Profiles candidate messenger RNA (mRNA) constructs supplied as
    a 5' untranslated region (UTR), coding sequence and 3' UTR, using
    sequence alone. Computes the UTR sequence features that drive
    translation initiation and transcript stability, including Kozak
    context, upstream open reading frames, a lightweight secondary
    structure proxy and 3' UTR decay elements, and ranks candidate designs
    against one another on those UTR features. Coding sequence features are
    reported as context but are not scored. Visualises the whole construct
    as a single annotated multi-track map.
